message: "Cite this bounded research snapshot, not a claimed resolution of P versus NP."
type: software
title: "Komorebi Circuit Obstructions: Restoration, Discrepancy Covers, and Projection Limits"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
authors:
  - family-names: "Komorebi P."
abstract: >-
  A closed-scope collection of written mathematical arguments and exact finite
  checkers for classical restored circuits, complete discrepancy covers, and
  projection limitations. Developed with AI assistance. Not a P-versus-NP proof,
  claim of independent review or publication novelty. C01, the maintained NCT
  degree dependency, and the C02 lower-bound component have Lean-checked proofs.
  The C02 dual and C03-C08 retain written and finite-check status.
keywords:
  - Boolean circuits
  - reversible computation
  - exact verification
  - discrepancy covers
